# What happens?

### First request

```text
GET /users/101
       ↓
@Cacheable
       ↓
Redis MISS
       ↓
Database
       ↓
Save result in Redis
       ↓
Return User
```

### Second request

```text
GET /users/101
       ↓
@Cacheable
       ↓
Redis HIT
       ↓
Return User
```

Database call nahi hoga.

