# Cache Invalidation

Ye interview mein **bahut important** hai.

Suppose Redis mein:

```text
users::101 → {
    "id": 101,
    "name": "Prem"
}
```

Database mein name update hua:

```text
Prem → Premendra
```

Lekin Redis mein purana data hai.

Agar cache invalidate nahi kiya:

```text
Application
     ↓
Redis
     ↓
Old data ❌
```

Isliye update/delete ke baad:

```java
@CacheEvict(
    value = "users",
    key = "#id"
)
```

ya update ke case mein:

```java
@CachePut(
    value = "users",
    key = "#id"
)
```

---

# `@CacheEvict(allEntries = true)`

Agar poora cache clear karna ho:

```java
@CacheEvict(
    value = "users",
    allEntries = true
)
public void clearUserCache() {
}
```

Conceptually:

```text
users::1
users::2
users::3
users::4
       ↓
   DELETE ALL
```

